{"5092530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ASURA BEAT", "steam_appid": 5092530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASURA BEAT is a rhythm slash action game where every hit lands on the beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters pour down the highway. Read the drop, slash in the critical window, and ride your combo. Miss the timing and you take the hit — stay locked to the music and the score explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SLASH ON THE BEAT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six lanes. Keyboard rhythm combat. Critical windows, leak pressure, and a ten-frame forward slash that has to feel right every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MODES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Arcade — Climb the stage tower, clear floors, unlock the next track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Solo — Pick a highway and chase your best run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Ranked — Six players. Live rival cams. Highest score takes LP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Team — Party rooms for coordinated play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOBS &amp; STYLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap playstyles — katana, fists, or dagger — and dress the run with skins from the shop. Burn mode turns a clean combo into a bigger number on screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILT FOR THE HIGHWAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of tracks and neon stages — cyber tunnels, night streets, forge heat, and deep-sea glow. Same rules, different pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASURA BEAT is about timing, nerve, and one more perfect slash before the chart ends.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASURA BEAT is a rhythm slash action game where every hit lands on the beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters pour down the highway. Read the drop, slash in the critical window, and ride your combo. Miss the timing and you take the hit — stay locked to the music and the score explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SLASH ON THE BEAT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six lanes. Keyboard rhythm combat. Critical windows, leak pressure, and a ten-frame forward slash that has to feel right every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MODES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Arcade — Climb the stage tower, clear floors, unlock the next track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Solo — Pick a highway and chase your best run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Ranked — Six players. Live rival cams. Highest score takes LP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Team — Party rooms for coordinated play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOBS &amp; STYLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap playstyles — katana, fists, or dagger — and dress the run with skins from the shop. Burn mode turns a clean combo into a bigger number on screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILT FOR THE HIGHWAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of tracks and neon stages — cyber tunnels, night streets, forge heat, and deep-sea glow. Same rules, different pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASURA BEAT is about timing, nerve, and one more perfect slash before the chart ends.</p>", "short_description": "A rhythm slash action game: monsters race down the highway, slash on the beat, chain crits, climb the arcade tower, and fight ranked PvP for the top score.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai